{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Her remnant.</b> A noun: wealth." "<b>He made.</b> Acquired, like עשה לי את החיל הזה (Deuteronomy 18:17)." "<b>And they carry.</b> From the root of פקדון (Leviticus 5:23). Now the wealth — they carry it to the Arabah of the brook. The correct reading is that their wealth they carry upon the brook known in their land, which is by the Arabs. The reason is that they transport their wealth to another place, perhaps it will remain theirs."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:55.689578131Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}